msgid "This blending mode is called \"Freeze\" in English."
msgstr "此混合模式的英文名为“Freeze”。"

#: ../../reference_manual/blending_modes/quadratic.rst:32
msgid "The Freeze blending mode. Inversion of the Reflect blending mode."
msgstr "冷却模式相当于反射模式的反相。"

